WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.752
Priya: Last part. Let's close out the action items.

2
00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:08.160
Priya: So, who's picking up the rotation test?

3
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.664
Dan: That's me. I'll have it Friday.

4
00:00:11.664 --> 00:00:15.457
Priya: Friday's fine. And the alerting?

5
00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:19.489
Sam: Me. Thursday, most likely.

6
00:00:19.489 --> 00:00:24.313
Priya: Great. Now — the part nobody likes.

7
00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:25.177
Alex: Go on.

8
00:00:25.177 --> 00:00:30.409
Priya: Why did it take four hours? Nobody was heads-down on it.

9
00:00:30.409 --> 00:00:34.321
Alex: To be fair, we were thinking the nodes coming back is the fix.

10
00:00:34.321 --> 00:00:40.201
Priya: Right. So the third action item — one owner per incident.

11
00:00:40.201 --> 00:00:43.442
Priya: I'll take point on writing that rule up.

12
00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:48.554
Dan: Makes sense. Four people were watching, nobody was owning.

13
00:00:48.554 --> 00:00:54.770
Priya: Exactly. Okay, we're done. Thanks everyone.

